        "label": "Yutu rover surface operations",
        "description": "Yutu (\"Jade Rabbit\") rolled off the lander ramp 2013-12-15 and operated for ~114 m of driving before a mechanism failure stopped its mobility on day 42. The lander continued surface science for years afterward; Yutu kept transmitting from the spot it stopped."
